  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.23 Household",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.23 “Household” means one person, a family, or a group of persons who could be related by blood, marriage, or adoption and who occupy a single housing unit.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
